From 7994664113cca922872d1cb9e57221412206f3eb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gao <gao@local>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 11:03:56 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] abi: regenerate VNDK 64-bit libstagefright_foundation
 baseline

The 64-bit build re-derives the source-based libstagefright_foundation
.lsdump; the -allow-unreferenced-changes abidiff flag already
accepts the EXTENDING CHANGES (the same C++ sources compile into a
slightly different aarch64 ELF).
